description	"The Clone Trooper

Based on open mode's clone trooper class, but given the full set of upgrades (with repeater instead of clone rifle) and double the reinforcements.

^2Weaponry:
- Blaster Pistol (2)
- Blaster Rifle (2)
- Imperial Heavy Repeater (2)
-- 12 Concussion Blobs

^8Attributes:
- Stamina (3)
- Heal (2)
- 3 Reinforcements (CTF: 7.5s Respawn)
- Assemble (1)

^2Strengths^7: Strikes a good balance between individual troop strength and numbers.
^1Weaknesses^7: Somewhat ineffectual at close and long ranges."